# 这是发布仓库：只放 APK、文档和 LGPL 组件材料。
# 下面这些是保险栓——签名材料和应用源码**绝不能**进到这里来。
# This is the distribution repo. The rules below are a safety net: signing material and
# application source must never land here.

# 签名材料 / signing material
keystore/
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# 应用源码与构建产物（本仓库不发布源代码）
# Application source and build outputs (source is not published here)
android/
app/
src/
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
local.properties
*.iml
.idea/

# 中间产物 / intermediates
*.aab
*.apk.idsig
mapping.txt

# 系统垃圾 / OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# 例外：发布用的 APK 与随包的 LGPL 库必须提交
# Exceptions: the released APK and the bundled LGPL libraries are tracked on purpose
!apk/*.apk
!ffmpeg/prebuilt/**/*.so
